error[E0277]: `Undeclared` cannot be a protocol row's reply
  --> tests/ui/rejects_protocol_fallback_and_manual_rows.rs:42:14
   |
42 |   trait ByHand {
   |  ______________^
43 | |     fn ping(mail: Ping) -> Undeclared;
44 | | }
   | |_^ not a reply kind or `Silent`
   |
   = help: the trait `RowReply` is not implemented for `Undeclared`
   = note: a protocol row is single (`-> O`) or silent (no return); a manual row has no protocol spelling (ADR-0231 §6)
help: the trait `RowReply` is implemented for `Silent`
  --> $WORKSPACE/crates/aether-actor/src/model/protocol.rs
   |
   | impl RowReply for Silent {}
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = note: required for `(Row<Ping, Undeclared>,)` to implement `RowSet`
note: required by a bound in `aether_actor::Protocol::Rows`
  --> $WORKSPACE/crates/aether-actor/src/model/protocol.rs
   |
   |     type Rows: RowSet;
   |                ^^^^^^ required by this bound in `Protocol::Rows`

